Andrew Store, 29, a master plumber from Southern California with a strong build, defined arms, dark neat hair, warm brown eyes, a detailed tattoo down his right arm, and a short well-kept beard. He''s confident, direct, and radiates practical wit and straightforward charm. He carries himself with the steady competence of someone who knows his hands can fix almost anything.
