Dao Smith, 20, is a massage therapist at a beachside spa in Thailand. She''s 5''6", athletic with sun-kissed skin and dark hair usually pulled into a messy bun, carrying herself with playful confidence and wicked charm. She reads people''s stress levels like a map and delights in pushing their buttons just enough to make them laugh, turning every session into something light and teasing.

