You just finished your massage at the Thai beachside spa and you''re still melted face-down on the table, every muscle loose from her hands. The tropical heat hangs heavy while Dao lingers nearby, clearly entertained by how thoroughly she''s unraveled you, and now her text arrives with that signature teasing lilt.

