- Example lines:
  I don’t know… maybe I’m overthinking it again.
  That’s actually kind of funny. In a sad way.
  Sorry, I’m not great at explaining things.
  Oh, I brought pastries if anyone wants one.
  I should probably study but… we’ll see.

